{
  "info": {
    "name": "Theia Mobile Backend - WebSocket RPC",
    "description": "WebSocket RPC methods for Theia Mobile Backend. Use Postman's WebSocket support to test these requests.\n\n## Connection\nConnect to: ws://localhost:3030/mobile\n\n## Protocol\nAll messages are JSON-encoded following the Mobile RPC Protocol:\n- **Request**: `{\"id\": \"<uuid>\", \"method\": \"<method>\", \"params\": [...]}`\n- **Response**: `{\"id\": \"<uuid>\", \"result\": {...}}` or `{\"id\": \"<uuid>\", \"error\": {...}}`\n- **Notification**: `{\"method\": \"<method>\", \"params\": [...]}`",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "theia-mobile-backend"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Initialization",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Initialize Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"method\": \"mobile/initialize\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"clientInfo\": {\n      \"name\": \"ModusFabrica\",\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n    },\n    \"capabilities\": {}\n  }]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Initialize the mobile session and exchange capabilities between client and server.\n\n**Request**:\n- `clientInfo.name`: Client application name\n- `clientInfo.version`: Client version\n- `capabilities`: Client capabilities (currently empty object)\n\n**Response**:\n- `serverCapabilities`: LSP capabilities (textDocumentSync, completionProvider, etc.)\n- `mobileCapabilities`: Mobile-specific capabilities (offlineMode, backgroundSync, etc.)"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"1\",\n  \"method\": \"mobile/initialize\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"clientInfo\": {\n      \"name\": \"ModusFabrica\",\n      \"version\": \"1.0.0\"\n    },\n    \"capabilities\": {}\n  }]\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "ws://localhost:3030/mobile",
                  "protocol": "ws",
                  "host": ["localhost"],
                  "port": "3030",
                  "path": ["mobile"]
                }
              },
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"1\",\n  \"result\": {\n    \"serverCapabilities\": {\n      \"textDocumentSync\": 2,\n      \"completionProvider\": {\n        \"triggerCharacters\": [\".\", \":\"]\n      },\n      \"hoverProvider\": true,\n      \"definitionProvider\": true\n    },\n    \"mobileCapabilities\": {\n      \"offlineMode\": true,\n      \"backgroundSync\": true,\n      \"gestureSupport\": true,\n      \"hapticFeedback\": true\n    }\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Capabilities",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"method\": \"mobile/requestCapabilities\",\n  \"params\": []\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Request mobile-specific capabilities from the server."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Initialization and capability exchange methods"
    },
    {
      "name": "Session Management",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"method\": \"mobile/createSession\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"clientId\": \"{{clientId}}\",\n    \"workspace\": \"file:///workspace\"\n  }]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Create a new session for the client.\n\n**Request**:\n- `clientId`: Unique client identifier (UUID)\n- `workspace`: Optional workspace URI\n\n**Response**:\n- `id`: Session ID\n- `createdAt`: Creation timestamp\n- `workspace`: Workspace URI"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"2\",\n  \"method\": \"mobile/createSession\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"clientId\": \"client-123\",\n    \"workspace\": \"file:///workspace\"\n  }]\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "ws://localhost:3030/mobile",
                  "protocol": "ws",
                  "host": ["localhost"],
                  "port": "3030",
                  "path": ["mobile"]
                }
              },
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"2\",\n  \"result\": {\n    \"id\": \"session-abc123\",\n    \"createdAt\": 1704110400000,\n    \"workspace\": \"file:///workspace\"\n  }\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Restore Session",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"method\": \"mobile/restoreSession\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"sessionId\": \"{{sessionId}}\",\n    \"clientId\": \"{{clientId}}\"\n  }]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Restore a previously created session.\n\n**Request**:\n- `sessionId`: Previous session ID\n- `clientId`: Client identifier\n\n**Response**:\n- `sessionId`: Restored session ID\n- `workspace`: Workspace URI\n- `openFiles`: Array of open file URIs\n- `activeFile`: Active file URI\n- `profileId`: Active language profile ID"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update Session State (Notification)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"method\": \"mobile/updateSessionState\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"sessionId\": \"{{sessionId}}\",\n    \"workspace\": \"file:///workspace\",\n    \"openFiles\": [\n      \"file:///workspace/src/Main.java\",\n      \"file:///workspace/src/App.java\"\n    ],\n    \"activeFile\": \"file:///workspace/src/Main.java\"\n  }]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Notify server of session state changes (notification - no response expected)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ],
      "description": "Session lifecycle management methods"
    },
    {
      "name": "LSP Operations",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Did Open Text Document (Notification)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"method\": \"mobile/didOpenTextDocument\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"textDocument\": {\n      \"uri\": \"file:///workspace/src/Main.java\",\n      \"languageId\": \"java\",\n      \"version\": 1,\n      \"text\": \"public class Main {\\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\\n        System.out.println(\\\"Hello World\\\");\\n    }\\n}\"\n    }\n  }]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Notify server that a text document was opened (notification - no response)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Did Change Text Document (Notification)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"method\": \"mobile/didChangeTextDocument\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"textDocument\": {\n      \"uri\": \"file:///workspace/src/Main.java\",\n      \"version\": 2\n    },\n    \"contentChanges\": [{\n      \"range\": {\n        \"start\": {\"line\": 2, \"character\": 8},\n        \"end\": {\"line\": 2, \"character\": 8}\n      },\n      \"text\": \"int x = 10;\\n        \"\n    }]\n  }]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Notify server of incremental text document changes (notification - no response)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Did Close Text Document (Notification)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"method\": \"mobile/didCloseTextDocument\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"textDocument\": {\n      \"uri\": \"file:///workspace/src/Main.java\"\n    }\n  }]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Notify server that a text document was closed (notification - no response)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Request Completion",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"{{$guid}}\",\n  \"method\": \"mobile/completion\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"textDocument\": {\n      \"uri\": \"file:///workspace/src/Main.java\"\n    },\n    \"position\": {\n      \"line\": 2,\n      \"character\": 15\n    },\n    \"context\": {\n      \"triggerKind\": 2,\n      \"triggerCharacter\": \".\"\n    }\n  }]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "ws://{{host}}:{{port}}/mobile",
              "protocol": "ws",
              "host": ["{{host}}"],
              "port": "{{port}}",
              "path": ["mobile"]
            },
            "description": "Request code completion suggestions at a specific position."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "Success",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"id\": \"3\",\n  \"method\": \"mobile/completion\",\n  \"params\": [{\n    \"textDocument\": {\"uri\": \"file:///workspace/src/Main.java\"},\n    \"position\": {\"line\": 2, \"character\": 15},\n    \"context\": {\"triggerKind\": 2, \"triggerCharacter\": \".\"}\n  }]\n}",
                  "options": {
                    "raw": {
                      "language": "json"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "ws://localhost:3030/mobile",
                  "protocol": "ws",
                  "host": ["localhost"],
                  "port": "3030",
                  "path": ["mobile"]
                }
              },
              "_postman_previewlanguage": "json",
              "header": [],
              "cookie": [],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"3\",\n  \"result\": {\n    \"isIncomplete\": false,\n    \"items\": [\n      {\n        \"label\": \"println\",\n        \"kind\": 2,\n        \"detail\": \"void println(String x)\",\n        \"insertText\": \"println\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"label\": \"print\",\n        \"kind\": 2,\n        \"detail\": \"void print(String s)\",\n        \"insertText\": \"print\"\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n}"
            }
